CHDIR - change the current directory››Syntax:› CHDIR [d:][path]››Aliases: CD, CWD››Makes the given directory the current›one on that drive (the current drive›if none is given). Files named without›a path are looked for there. With no›parameter the current directory of the›current drive is shown.››When the disk is changed, the current›directory goes back to MAIN.››Examples:› CD >GAMES>ARCADE› CD ..› CD D2:>››See also: MKDIR, RMDIR, PWD, PATH›